 "change": "OriginalMacRuntimeMenu.step's first resume runs Driver.resumeIdleDirect: resumeIdleFirst's idle attempt with no Driver, exchange, claim or lock. Queue requests are answered by the same direct server through a cursor of no exchange (Exchange.standaloneCursor); the publication makes the cursor checks finish would (Cursor.requireConsumed; a fresh exchange passes the others). A committed idle iteration needs no driver at all (the step's driver is a lazy local). Otherwise the lane returns its replies, prepared inputs and declined request, and a fresh driver of the same committed sequence continues (resumeAfterIdle): the replies are recorded as resumeIdleFirst records them, then the declined request is claimed (claimNext) or the whole step runs over a cursor that replays them with the same inputs. Later resumes are unchanged",
